{"id": "t076-016", "text": "Spoke to Georgia after the meeting. Her flight to Toronto got cancelled twice last week and she finally landed on Sunday. Her luggage is still somewhere in Frankfurt. She's there until November 2nd for her cousin's wedding and has had to buy a whole new outfit for it. Remind me to message her on Monday to check the bag turned up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Georgia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the meeting"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flight to Toronto", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "until November 2nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
