{"id": "t076-021", "text": "Duc's parents are visiting from Hanoi for a month, arriving next Wednesday. He's been deep cleaning the flat all week and is slightly panicking about cooking for his mum, who apparently judges everyone's broth. His dad is diabetic, so no sweet stuff either. They're also hoping to do a few days in Scotland while they're here, probably the weekend after next.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting from Hanoi", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "slightly panicking", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "judges everyone's broth", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "diabetic", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "no sweet stuff", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "few days in Scotland", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "while they're here", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after next", "anchor": "e2"}]}
