{"id": "t076-031", "text": "Meera said Yasmin is pregnant! Due in March. Very early days so they're keeping it quiet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yasmin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t076-032", "text": "Noah came back from Lisbon raving about the custard tarts. He's now trying to make them at home and has ruined three batches.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "came back from Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "custard tarts", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t076-033", "text": "Varun is nervous about his citizenship test next Monday. He's been revising on the train every morning. I should send him a message on Sunday evening, just to say good luck.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "citizenship test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him a message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t076-034", "text": "Siobhan's husband Duc is lactose intolerant, which I had completely forgotten. Pick up oat milk before they come round on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siobhan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "lactose intolerant", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Pick up oat milk", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "come round", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t076-035", "text": "Kwame told me his retirement party is on the 15th, a Friday, at the cricket club. He's finally finishing after thirty-one years at the council. His wife Angela is planning a surprise slideshow, so don't mention it to him. Must get a card and get everyone in the office to sign it by the Wednesday before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retirement party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 15th, a Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "finishing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get everyone in the office to sign it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the Wednesday before", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t076-036", "text": "Georgia's sister Kiara keeps dropping hints about a pasta machine. Christmas sorted.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Georgia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dropping hints about a pasta machine", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas"}]}
{"id": "t076-037", "text": "Joe said the stag in Prague has been called off. The groom's dad isn't well, so they're doing a quiet night locally instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "groom"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't well", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quiet night", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t076-038", "text": "Long call with Tiago this evening. His visa interview at the consulate is November 4th and he's been stressing about it for weeks because the paperwork keeps changing. If it goes through, they'll move to Porto in the new year, and his wife already has a job lined up there. He's also trying to learn Portuguese properly, as in the European kind, which he says is harder than it sounds. Remember to ask him how the interview went that afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tiago", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this evening"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visa interview at the consulate", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 4th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move to Porto", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "job lined up", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Portuguese", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how the interview went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t076-039", "text": "Isaac has started keto. Two weeks in, says he misses bread more than he misses people. His girlfriend Zoe is doing it with him for moral support, although she admitted to a secret croissant on Tuesday. He's aiming to stick with it until his holiday in Crete on July 4th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "keto", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Two weeks in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "misses bread", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "holiday in Crete", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 4th", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t076-040", "text": "Groceries for the week, then the post office. Also need to sort my passport renewal, it expires in May.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Groceries", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "the post office", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort my passport renewal", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May", "anchor": "a3"}]}
{"id": "t076-041", "text": "Dalia told me her grandmother passed away last Thursday. The funeral is in Beirut, so she's flying out on Sunday with her mum.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t076-042", "text": "Mrs Santos next door is going to Madeira for a fortnight from Tuesday. I said I'd water her plants and feed the cat, Pepper, who only eats the expensive pouches. Her husband is staying behind because of work, but he's away most weekdays. Key is under the blue pot. She's back on the 9th, a Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Santos", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Madeira", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat, Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "only eats the expensive pouches", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "away most weekdays", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th, a Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t076-043", "text": "Remind me to ask Grace whether she found that gluten-free bakery in Shoreditch.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Grace whether she found that gluten-free bakery in Shoreditch", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Grace", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t076-044", "text": "Bumped into Wiremu and his partner Kiri at the market. They're both training for the Auckland half marathon on 3/15 and have cut out alcohol until then. Kiri is the more competitive one.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wiremu", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Auckland half marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3/15", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cut out alcohol", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until then", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "more competitive one", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t076-045", "text": "Hoang got the job at the hospital! Starts on October 27. He sounded so relieved, he'd been applying since summer.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hoang", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at the hospital", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Starts", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "October 27", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since summer"}]}
{"id": "t076-046", "text": "Anders is a huge whisky person. Islay, peaty, the smokier the better.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "whisky", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Islay", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "peaty", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t076-047", "text": "Aarav's flight to Melbourne was delayed by nine hours and he missed his connection. He's finally there now but slept in Doha airport.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aarav", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flight to Melbourne", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t076-048", "text": "Zoe and her boyfriend Carlos broke up over the weekend. The trip to Mexico they had booked for December is obviously off now. She seemed okay but I think she's putting on a brave face. Her mum is flying over from Dublin on Friday to stay for a bit, which should help. I should take her out for dinner next week, somewhere vegetarian since she's given up meat again.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carlos", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "December"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "okay", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "putting on a brave face", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying over from Dublin", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a bit", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her out for dinner", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "given up meat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t076-049", "text": "Booked the train to Manchester for Thursday the 23rd. Still need to print the tickets, sort a hotel near Piccadilly and find someone to take the parcel in if it comes on the Friday. Also cancel the Thursday yoga class and move my haircut to next Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "train to Manchester", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday the 23rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "print the tickets", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort a hotel near Piccadilly", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "find someone to take the parcel in", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Friday", "anchor": "a3"}, {"id": "a4", "type": "ACTION", "text": "cancel the Thursday yoga class", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "yoga class", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a5", "type": "ACTION", "text": "move my haircut", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "haircut", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "to next Saturday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t076-050", "text": "Laura is doing a cookery course in Bologna in the spring. She's been talking about it for years.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cookery course in Bologna", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t076-051", "text": "Spoke to Suzanne. Her son Rohan is moving to Dubai for work on May 2nd. She's proud but obviously sad about it, and she's already planning a visit at Christmas.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Dubai", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 2nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sad", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visit", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t076-052", "text": "Angela can't have any nuts at all, including coconut. She mentioned it twice tonight so it clearly matters.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't have any nuts at all, including coconut", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}]}
{"id": "t076-053", "text": "Don't forget to call Tunde tomorrow to see how his dad's scan went.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call Tunde", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t076-054", "text": "Need to get Euros before the trip, and check whether the travel insurance covers skiing.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get Euros", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check whether the travel insurance covers skiing", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t076-055", "text": "Xavier has a fear of flying and is dreading the long haul to Sydney next month. He's thinking about doing one of those courses before he goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Xavier", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fear of flying", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "long haul to Sydney", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before he goes", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t076-056", "text": "Giulia's little boy Noah turns five on Saturday. She wants something to do with dinosaurs, nothing noisy.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "little boy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns five", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants something to do with dinosaurs", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "nothing noisy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t076-057", "text": "Lovely evening with Meera, Varun and Joe. Varun is hosting a Diwali dinner on November 8th and asked everyone to bring a dessert. Meera is doing gulab jamun because she can't help herself. Joe is threatening to bring a shop-bought trifle again. I'll make the pistachio cake and should ask Varun if anyone else is coeliac apart from his cousin.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Diwali dinner", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 8th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Varun if anyone else is coeliac apart from his cousin", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "coeliac", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t076-058", "text": "Björn is in Stockholm until next Wednesday. His dad's seventieth is on the Sunday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Björn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "in Stockholm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until next Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "seventieth", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t076-059", "text": "Remember to move the bins out Tuesday night.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "move the bins out", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t076-060", "text": "Duc mentioned he's been feeling really low since moving here. Misses his family and the food, mostly the food. I need to invite him over for pho on Sunday, or at least find a good place nearby.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "low", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since moving here"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite him over for pho", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "find a good place nearby", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
